      "filename": "Lakes in Democratic Republic of the Congo (MODIS 2019-05-28).jpg",
      "title": "File:Lakes in Democratic Republic of the Congo (MODIS 2019-05-28).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/26/Lakes_in_Democratic_Republic_of_the_Congo_%28MODIS_2019-05-28%29.jpg",
